*.orig

#wwwroot - ignore app-thumbnails subdirectories but keep README.md
wwwroot/app-thumbnails/**
!wwwroot/app-thumbnails/
!wwwroot/app-thumbnails/README.md

# Ignore any nested project `wwwroot/app-thumbnails` folders as well
**/wwwroot/app-thumbnails/**
!**/wwwroot/app-thumbnails/
!**/wwwroot/app-thumbnails/README.md

# Ignore any nested project `wwwroot/app-screenshots` folders as well
**/wwwroot/app-screenshots/**
!**/wwwroot/app-screenshots/
!**/wwwroot/app-screenshots/README.md

